.TH "TEST-MODULE" "1" "October 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
test:module \- Run native Parikshak automated test suites for an isolated module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php test:module
.I <modulename>
[\fB\-\-filter=\fIpattern\fR]
[\fB\-\-compact\fR|\fB\-c\fR]
[\fB\-\-profile\fR]
[\fB\-\-bail\fR|\fB\-x\fR]
[\fB\-\-coverage\fR]
[\fB\-\-teamcity\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBtest:module\fR executes unit and feature test suites defined in an isolated module's
\fBtests/\fR directory using SPP's primary native testing engine, Parikshak.
Tests must extend \fB\\SPPMod\\Parikshak\\SPPTestCase\fR or \fB\\SPPMod\\Parikshak\\TestCase\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR <modulename>
Internal name or directory basename of the module to test.
.TP
.BR \-\-filter= \fIpattern\fR
Filter tests by class or method name regex pattern.
.TP
.BR \-\-compact ", " \-c
Output minimal progress and only print detailed traces for failed tests.
.TP
.BR \-\-profile
Measure test execution timings and display the 5 slowest tests.
.TP
.BR \-\-bail ", " \-x
Halt test suite execution immediately on first failure.
.TP
.BR \-\-coverage
Generate code coverage report (requires Xdebug or PCOV).
.TP
.BR \-\-teamcity
Format output as TeamCity service messages.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Resolves module metadata, provisions an in-memory SQLite isolation sandbox, and
invokes \fB\\SPPMod\\Parikshak\\SPPTestRunner::runDirectory()\fR.
.SH AUTHOR
Satya Prakash Shukla
